{"t": 1795087419.8238873, "tool": "analyze", "code": "from scipy.optimize import least_squares\nfams={\n 'F1':lambda p: p[0]/eps*np.exp(-p[1]*eps*T)+p[2]*eps+p[3]+p[4]*np.log(eps)+p[5]/T,\n 'F2':lambda p: p[0]/eps+p[1]*eps+p[2]+p[3]*eps**2*T+p[4]*eps*np.log(T)+p[5]/T,\n 'F3':lambda p: p[0]*np.log(p[1]+1/eps)+p[2]*eps+p[3]+p[4]*eps**2*T+p[5]/T,\n 'F4':lambda p: p[0]/eps+p[1]*eps+p[2]+p[3]*eps**2*np.exp(p[4]*T)+p[5]*np.log(eps),\n 'F5':lambda p: p[0]/eps+p[1]*eps**p[2]+p[3]+p[4]*T*eps+p[5]/T,\n 'F6':lambda p: p[0]/eps+p[1]*eps+p[2]+p[3]*eps**2*T+p[4]*eps*T**p[5],\n}\nfor k,f in fams.items():\n    bestr=None\n    for s in range(20):\n        p0=np.random.RandomState(s).randn(6)\n        try:\n            r=least_squares(lambda p: f(p)-sigma, p0)\n            if np.all(np.isfinite(r.fun)) and (bestr is None or r.cost<bestr.cost): bestr=r\n        except Exception as ex: pass\n    print(k, np.mean(bestr.fun**2)/np.var(sigma), np.round(bestr.x,4))", "out": "F1 0.01055394278717768 [ 0.592  -0.1567  1.5004 -4.7884 -6.1497  0.2646]\nF2 0.0007113824949097439 [ 2.256  -1.9626 -0.3975  0.1674 -1.3558 -2.5375]\nF3 0.00585062923027501 [ 9.419   1.2596 -1.8104 -9.1931  0.1068  3.137 ]\nF4 0.005008119341956367 [ 1.9827 -3.0343 -1.5011  0.3164  0.154  -0.9426]\nF5 0.02704444090695993 [ -1.8224  28.2993  -0.327  -33.2015   0.5293   8.794 ]\nF6 0.0016888458763858688 [ 2.35870e+00 -4.41371e+01 -1.43800e+00  1.58200e-01  4.19606e+01\n -2.49000e-02]\n\n[stderr]\n<string>:8: RuntimeWarning: invalid value encountered in log\n"}
